      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>S4 \xB7 WIR-020 \xB7 TRIGGER AT A DOORWAY</b>\n<size=62%>Room B and
    its opening sit inside a Default-layer trigger with no script, like Zona1's Amb_*
    zones. The yellow line on the floor is its edge.\nPASS: it sees you and catches
    you across the edge, from either side.</size>"
