  m_text: "<b>S1 \xB7 WIR-028 \xB7 STAIRS WITH DOORS</b>\n<size=62%>Zona1's stairwell
    turned 180\xB0: two Bridges_stairs_2 flights, Stair_Divider and its cap, the
    Bridges_1 landing, and a DoorMetalRed at the foot and at the top (Zona1's stair-door
    size).\nPASS: the Nemesis goes up AND down without getting stuck, through both
    doors.</size>"
