  m_text: "<b>S3 \xB7 WIR-018 / WIR-024 \xB7 UNREACHABLE BALCONY</b>\n<size=62%>2.6
    m up. The ramp is 0.8 m wide: you fit, the Nemesis (1 m) does not. Stand up here
    where it can see you.\nPASS: it goes to the closest point, stops running in place,
    searches and goes back to patrol - it does not stay planted underneath, staring.</size>"
